\f3\b File:
\f5\b0  \cf7 collect_notes_interactively()\cf2 , lines 181\'96189\
\
  The double-blank-line sentinel to end input is reasonable for typed notes, but breaks when a\
   user pastes formatted notes that contain intentional blank lines between bullet groups.\
  Input is truncated at the first double blank, silently.\
\
  
\f3\b Fix:
\f5\b0  Default the terminator to \cf7 end\cf2  (already supported) and make the double-blank behavior\
  opt-in, or increase the blank-streak threshold, or prompt the user to use \cf7 end\cf2  more\
  prominently.\
\
