\f3\b File:
\f5\b0  \cf7 main()\cf2  / \cf7 generate_report()\cf2 \
\
  There's no way to generate a stakeholder-facing email summary alongside or instead of the\
  full report. This is a high-value workflow for PMs and engineering leads who need to\
  communicate status upward after generating the internal report. The model is already primed\
  with all the right context.\
\
  
\f3\b Fix:
\f5\b0  Add a \cf7 --email\cf2  flag that makes a second (or combined) API call using the generated\
  report as input to produce a concise stakeholder email draft, appended to the output file\
  under an \cf7 ## Email Draft\cf2  section.\
  \
