\f3\b File:
\f5\b0  \cf7 generate_report()\cf2 , line 262\
\
  \cf7 next(b.text for b in response.content if b.type == "text")\cf2  raises \cf7 StopIteration\cf2  if the API\
  response contains no text block \'97 theoretically possible if the model returns only a tool\
  call or an error block. A safer pattern is \cf7 next((...), "")\cf2  with a default and an error\
  check.\
